            "product": "colamy-noya-mid-century-modern-upholstered-dining-chair"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_kP9KBE": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/61wE3ZZ8gfL.jpg",
            "text": "<p><strong>Excellent upgrade</strong></p><p>Excellent value! The Atlas competes with $500-$1000 chairs for under $300. It features premium build quality, a firm yet comfortable seat, and solid adjustable mechanisms. If you prioritize functional performance over branding and prestige, this is a top-tier ergonomic choice.</p>",
            "avatar": "shopify://shop_images/XK.png",
            "author": "Schadenfreudist",
            "bio": "",
            "product": "colamy-atlas-ergonomic-high-back-mesh-office-chair-bifma-certified"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_itecmG": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/71C3pdQPj1L.jpg",
            "text": "<p><strong>Very sturdy and strong frame</strong></p><p>Great designs and easy to assemble, frame is study and well built. Very excited once we put them together! They were easy to assemble, very comfortable, and the seat size and height are perfect for my counter. They look amazing too.</p>",
            "avatar": "shopify://shop_images/ACF05.png",
            "author": "Nicole",
            "bio": "",
            "product": "colamy-arla-upholstered-wooden-scandi-minimalist-counter-height-bar-stool"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_U8TJBM": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/71nUyvoXroL.jpg",
            "text": "<p><strong>Super heavy and robust.</strong></p><p>Awesome desk, heavy but really solid. Lumidesk has exceeded my expectations. It's so beautiful. It looks luxury and premium compared to other same price range standing desks. Lightning fast customers service. I am an extremely happy customer.</p>",
            "author": "Ocisly",
            "bio": "",
            "product": "lumidesk-all-in-1-electric-height-adjustable-desk"
          }
        },
